# Nginx Proxy Manager safety

## Read-only default

List proxy hosts, certificates, and access lists are fine when NPM work is
authorized. Do **not**:

- delete or disable a proxy host, redirection, or stream
- delete SSL certificates or force-renew in bulk
- widen an access list / remove IP restrictions

…unless the user gave an explicit verb this turn naming the object.

Apex / mail-adjacent host changes: say what breaks if wrong. Prefer
update-in-place over delete+recreate. Never paste admin passwords or API
tokens into chat.
